{"strongs": "H7198", "word": "קֶ֫שֶׁת", "translit": "qe.shet", "root": "קשש", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "bow", "definition": "קֶ֫שֶׁת noun feminine Gen 9:14 (apparently masculine 2Sam 1:22 but see Albr ZAW xvi (1896) 91 ) bow (originally √ perhaps קושׁ , meaning unknown; Late Hebrew id. ; Assyrian ‡aštu ; Ethiopic Arabic plural , etc.; ᵑ7 and ( קַשְׁתָּא and ( ט for ת after ק P ) קוּשְׁטָא (rare), all bow , קַשָּׁתָא bowman ; Syriac bow , bowman ; Old Aramaic קשת bow , Mandean כשטא ( Frä 206 ); Palmyrene קשטא bowman ); — absolute ׳ ק Hos 1:7 +, קָ֑שֶׁת Jer 46:9 +; construct קֶ֫שֶׁת Hos 1:5 +; suffix קַשְׁתִּי Gen 48:22 + ,etc.; plural absolute קְשָׁתוֺת 2Chr 26:14 +; suffix קַשְּׁתֹתָיו ( Ges «GKC:20h»§ 20h ) Isa 5:28 , קַשְּׁתוֺתָם Jer 51:56 ; Ps 37:15 , קַשְּׁתֹתֵיהֶם Neh 4:7 ( קַשְׁתֹּתָיו etc., van d. H. [except Ps 37:15 ]); — 1. bow : \\ \\ a. for hunting Gen 27:3 ( J ; + תְּלְי ) \\ \\ b. battle: + (or ||) חֶרֶב Gen 48:22 ; Josh 24:12 (both E ), Hos 1:7 ; Hos 2:20 ; 1Sam 18:4 (+ חְַגֹרוֺ ), 2Sam 1:22 ; 2Kgs 6:22 ; Isa 41:2 ; Neh 4:7 (+ רָמְחֵיהֶם ), Zech 9:13 (figurative of Judah as ׳ י 's bow), Ps 37:15 (figurative) Ps 44:7 (+ or || חֶרֶב also below) ;+ (or ||) חִצִּים Isa 7:24 ; 2Kgs 13:15 (twice in verse); Ezek 39:3 ; Ezek 39:9 ; 1Chr 12:2 a; compare ׳ רִשְׁפֵי ק Ps 76:4 = arrow (+ מָנֵן וְחֶרֶב ) so ׳ בֶּן ק Job 41:20 (compare Lam 3:13 ; Job 5:7 ); + חֲנִית Ps 46:10 , + כִּידוֺן Jer 6:23 ; Jer 50:42 + varius weapons Neh 4:10 ; 2Chr 26:14 alone Isa 13:18 (context corrupt), Isa 22:3 ; Jer 51:56 ; Hab 3:9 (of ׳ י as warrior ); מִלְחָמָה ׳ ק Zech 9:10 ; Zech 10:4 in simile רְמִיָּה ׳ כְּק like a bow of deception Hos 7:16 ; Ps 78:57 (i.e. one that misses its aim; al. slack bow ). \\ \\ c. ׳ ק collective = bow (-men), archers Isa 21:17 . \\ \\ d. phrases are: ׳ הַמּרִים אֲנָשִׁים בַּקּ 1Sam 31:3 archers, bowmen (but dubious; Dr Kit Löhr translates, ׳ הַמּ ׳ א ; We Bu strike out ׳ א as || 1Chr 10:3 HPS Now strike out ׳ בַּקּ ׳ א ), ׳ הַמּוֺרִים בַּקּ 1Chr 10:3 ׳ מְטַחֲוֵי ק Gen 21:16 (see [ טָתָה ], ׳ רמֵה ק Jer 4:29 , compare perhaps Gen 21:21 see קִשָּׁת , || ׳ נשְׁקֵי ק (see II. נָשַׁק ) 1Chr 12:2 b 2Chr 17:17 , ׳ רוֺמֵי ק ׳ נוֺ Ps 78:9 ׳ תֹּפֵשׁ הַקּ Amos 2:15 one grasping the bow , (see Jer 46:9 below) see also ׳ מִלֵּא יָדוֺ בַקּ 2Kgs 9:24 , ׳ הַרְכֵּב יָֽדְךָ עַלהַֿקּ 2Kgs 13:16 ׳ דָּרַח ק bend (literally tread ) the bow , Isa 5:28 (participle passive), Isa 21:15 ( id. ; || חֶרֶב ) Jer 50:14 ; Jer 50:29 ; Jer 51:3 ; 1Chr 5:18 ; 1Chr 8:40 ; 2Chr 14:7 ; Ps 37:14 (|| חֶרֶב ), in figure Ps 11:2 (|| חֵץ ), and, of God, Lam 2:4 ; Lam 3:12 ; Ps 7:13 (|| הֶרֶב ); ׳ תֹּפְשֵׂי דֹּרְכֵי ק Jer 46:9 compare(figurative) וַיַּדְרְכוֺ אֶתלְֿשׁוֺנָם קַשְׁתָּם Jer 9:2 also נְחוּשָׁה וְנִחֲתָה ׳ ק Ps 18:35 = 2Sam 22:35 (read וְנִחֲתָה for וְנִחַת ) ׳ מָשַׁח בַּקּ draw the bow 1Kgs 22:34 = 2Chr 18:33 ; Isa 66:19 . \\ \\ e. bow (passing over into) figurative of might Gen 49:24 (poem), 1Sam 2:4 ; Hos 1:5 ; Jer 49:35 ; Job 29:20 (compare Ps 37:15 , \\ \\ b. above) feminine נְחוּשָׁה ׳ ק fig of divine judgment Job 20:24 (|| נֵשֶׁק בַּרְזֶל ) 2. rainbow : אֲשַׁר יִהְיֶה בֶעָנָן בְּיוֺם הַנֶּשֶׁם ׳ כְּמַרְאֵה הַקּ Ezek 1:28 ; Gen 9:13 ; Gen 9:14 ; Gen 9:16 ( P ). — קָ֑שֶׁה וַיּאֹמֶר לְלַמֵּד בְּנֵייְֿהוּדָה 2Sam 1:18 is corrupt; ᵐ5 al. omits; We Now think misplaced gloss on v 2Sam 1:6 see further HPS .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7653')\">BDB7653</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7198')\">H7198</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7652')\">BDB7652</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7654')\">BDB7654</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קֶ֫שֶׁת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 9:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,9,14)\">Gen 9:14</ref></sup> (apparently <b>masculine</b> <ref ref=\"2Sam 1:22\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(10,1,22)\">2Sam 1:22</ref> but see <loo